# Advanced / manual path — prefer docker run IMAGE bootstrap or compose bootstrap
#
# 1. First apply with local state (no backend.tf in terraform/).
# 2. cp terraform/backend.tf.in terraform/backend.tf
# 3. Write terraform/backend.hcl with bucket/key (see outputs tfstate_bucket, bootstrap_state_key).
# 4. Load AWS keys via Docker --env-file terraform/.backend-credentials (KEY=VALUE format).
# 5. cd terraform && terraform init -migrate-state -force-copy -backend-config=backend.hcl
